# >>> OPTIONAL. COPY THIS FILE TO "drive.properties" AND FILL IN YOUR OWN VALUES.
# >>> ISTEGE BAGLI. BU DOSYAYI "drive.properties" ADIYLA KOPYALAYIN VE KENDI DEGERLERINIZI GIRIN.
#
# Enables the "Export to Drive" button. Setup steps: drive-sync/README.md
# "Drive'a aktar" dugmesini etkinlestirir. Kurulum adimlari: drive-sync/README.tr.md
#
# drive.properties is in .gitignore - NEVER commit it.
# drive.properties .gitignore icinde - ASLA depoya eklemeyin.
#
# If left empty, the app still builds; the button just says "not configured".
# Bos birakilirsa uygulama yine derlenir; dugme "yapilandirilmadi" der.
#
# driveUrl    = the /exec URL of YOUR Apps Script web app      (Apps Script web uygulamanizin /exec adresi)
# driveSecret = the SAME value as SECRET in YOUR Kod.gs          (Kod.gs icindeki SECRET ile AYNI deger)
#               letters and digits only                          (yalnizca harf ve rakam)

driveUrl=https://script.google.com/macros/s/YOUR-DEPLOYMENT-ID/exec
driveSecret=YOUR-WRITE-SECRET
